Third-party notices for briard-tether
=====================================

The adapter rows in internal/family/family.go — USB vendor/product ids, the descriptor
words that tell one stick from another, and the baud and flow-control parameters — are
derived from zigbee-herdsman's src/adapter/adapterDiscovery.ts. They were translated into
this program's own matching scheme rather than copied verbatim, but the knowledge is
theirs: it comes from a project with the hardware and the user base to have tested it.

